WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.017
Recursive queries require extra care.

00:00:03.017 --> 00:00:06.557
A wrong join condition can produce too many rows.

00:00:06.557 --> 00:00:11.462
Cycles in the source hierarchy can also create problematic traversal.

00:00:11.462 --> 00:00:14.087
Test the anchor by itself.

00:00:14.087 --> 00:00:20.972
Inspect the recursive join. Use depth or path information while developing the query.

00:00:20.972 --> 00:00:24.644
Start with a small dataset so the behavior is visible.
